{
  "date": "2026-10-23",
  "requirements": {
    "FBR01": "Make Find & play a dedicated challenge-finding/racing destination, with no creation or management controls.",
    "FBR02": "Provide a clear native gallery, race hero, target, car/laps/tries, reward goals, separate complete standings and a prominent pinned Race action.",
    "FBR03": "Keep explicit search and format/car/order filters, paging, useful loading/empty/error/guest recovery and native input.",
    "FBR04": "Preserve draft search/focus, gallery position and detail tabs across scoped replies; leave Created when entering Find & play and refresh the catalogue.",
    "R01": "Retain exact target/PB/gap arithmetic, finite starts, full/ended/owner/guest gates, five laps, 3x3 stages, result verification, account fences and explicit creation management.",
    "G01": "Inspect actual native before/after views in Compatibility and desktop Mobile plus filter, standings, empty/error/guest/long-name/owner states.",
    "Q01": "Run existing focused and integrated regressions, preserve failing controls/corrections, source/asset fingerprints and a reviewable task-only checkpoint."
  },
  "changes": [
    "The initial choice and its distinct original artwork remain. Racing offers Discover, Friends and Joined; Create, Created, Share, Rematch and Cancel are removed from that destination. Explicit Created management and post-race results retain their existing actions.",
    "A native two-column gallery uses the actual biome image and up to96 actual route samples plus a closing point, with format, time, car, expiry and server reward information. No per-card world, new raster or runtime provider is added. Existing catalogue/receipt limits remain.",
    "Selected races have a scenic hero with the full original selected-track outline, exact target and personal comparison, car/laps/tries and a primary Race action outside the scrolling details. Separate native Race details/Standings tabs keep all20 standings reachable.",
    "Explicit search and collapsible format/car/sort controls reduce clutter. Empty, no-match, unavailable and guest states lead to clear filters, refresh/retry, Discover or sign-in.",
    "Existing request ownership is retained. Search drafts/focus and gallery position restore only for the same account/folder/filter scope; the selected detail tab restores only for the same scoped challenge. Browser Refresh now refreshes its catalogue. Find & play leaves prior Created management."
  ],
